**Read:** [Research Roadmap on Grid-Forming Inverters](../sources/Grid-Forming-Inverters-Research-Roadmap.lingua#r_1XBSV4CPJGZG5FE56MH7507WAF), entire report; [UNIFI grid-forming specifications, version 2](../sources/UNIFI-Grid-Forming-Specifications-Version-2.lingua#r_5SF91JRQ8TE46HXTXRK16P9KBZ), entire versioned specification; [Advance Power Electronics — Bhim Singh, IIT Delhi](../sources/Advanced-Power-Electronics-Bhim-Singh.lingua#r_4249XQH4D831ATDY73HJHCPRAS), complete relevant control, device and grid-interface modules; [DPsim — electromagnetic-transient and dynamic-phasor methods](../sources/DPsim-Transient-and-Dynamic-Phasor-Methods.lingua#r_6Y8PGZBGJHGV3JHZ1Q8XC77RR3), whole applicable domain/model methods.

Read all of [Research Roadmap on Grid-Forming Inverters](../sources/Grid-Forming-Inverters-Research-Roadmap.lingua#r_1XBSV4CPJGZG5FE56MH7507WAF), [UNIFI grid-forming specifications, version 2](../sources/UNIFI-Grid-Forming-Specifications-Version-2.lingua#r_5SF91JRQ8TE46HXTXRK16P9KBZ), the complete applicable [Advance Power Electronics — Bhim Singh, IIT Delhi](../sources/Advanced-Power-Electronics-Bhim-Singh.lingua#r_4249XQH4D831ATDY73HJHCPRAS) and [Feedback Systems — Åström and Murray](../sources/Feedback-Systems-Astrom-Murray.lingua#r_7N4SZEXCRGZZFW2EV9X86G7833) developments, and full primary model/test papers selected for the chosen controller. State the converter, source/storage energy, filter, measurement, network and unit/plant boundaries explicitly.

Derive the actual grid-forming equations and compare them with a grid-following and a synchronous-source alternative under the same service conditions. Include current/voltage limits, DC state, delay, mode transitions and protection interactions. Compare isolated, grid-connected and sharing behavior only within the chosen model/equipment scope.

Verify a small analytical limit and an independently implemented or differently formulated simulation, then compare suitable qualified tests or a complete published experiment. Test a changed network strength, unbalance and fault/limit transition not used in tuning. Distinguish a functional requirement, an implementation model and demonstrated plant behavior. The report must identify what still requires EMT, hardware or field evidence and explain any discrepancy without promoting one successful ideal case into unrestricted grid-forming capability.

**Continue:** [An integrated electrical-power-system investigation](../study/An-integrated-electrical-power-system-investigation.lingua#r_06BN864FF9C0AN3EWZJE78Y6Y3).

